"→ ``QueryRecordsTool``. Колонка «Автономный» показывает значение "
"``isAvailableForStatelessExecution()``: «да» — инструмент доступен при "
"вызове из BPMN и через ``POST /api/ai-agent/execute``, «нет» — только в "
"интерактивном диалоге."
msgstr ""
"The tables show the tool name — this is exactly what is written to the "
"agent's ``tools`` field. The implementation class is derived from the "
"name: ``queryRecords`` → ``QueryRecordsTool``. The \"Autonomous\" column "
"shows the value of ``isAvailableForStatelessExecution()``: \"Yes\" — the "
"tool is available when called from BPMN and via ``POST /api/ai-"
"agent/execute``; \"No\" — only in an interactive dialogue."

